[{"client_msg_id":"2BD51DC6-D629-4337-8616-217D8492746C","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"やりたいと思ってたやつだ","ts":"1620480691.392000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4JXJ8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8f982b4-fd99-4296-8a3c-65bdc4850684","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"FFで開くと開くってワンテンポなくてシームレスにつながってるのがいいんですよね。\nこういうVimにしたい（インテグ難しくてメンテコスト爆上げしそうだけど）","ts":"1620480580.391600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wuV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D5C6A7CD-E260-4E5B-90FA-0B8266BB360C","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"便利そう","ts":"1620480047.389600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fn0F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d3a4c03-7f2d-4070-a7ca-f3095992a2b6","type":"message","user":"UFP0GQZ4K","text":"fzf 連携はまだ試してないですが、これも便利そう","ts":"1620480017.389400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L1Ql"}]},{"client_msg_id":"427b2c15-c746-4bfe-9678-3d741d0792f2","type":"message","user":"UFP0GQZ4K","text":"いまさらになって、 \u003chttps://github.com/kevinhwang91/nvim-bqf|nvim-bqf\u003e を入れてみたのですが、これすごい便利ですね\n通常の quickfix ウィンドウにプレビューが表示されてびっくりした","ts":"1620479953.388900","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: kevinhwang91/nvim-bqf","id":1,"title":"kevinhwang91/nvim-bqf","title_link":"https://github.com/kevinhwang91/nvim-bqf","text":"Better quickfix window in Neovim, polish old quickfix window. - kevinhwang91/nvim-bqf","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/502c2ccf2ab00af99334fbaeab11c35a5c3ea23522ee2bc4d514d5a365a2e6c0/kevinhwang91/nvim-bqf","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/kevinhwang91/nvim-bqf","original_url":"https://github.com/kevinhwang91/nvim-bqf"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=2Uz"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U0217DB46P7","text":"\u003c@U0217DB46P7\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1620455809.386400","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"2ac152d5-d356-46cc-8c07-36c9a3e043b2","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"急ぎではないので、お時間あるときで大丈夫ですー","ts":"1620443839.382300","thread_ts":"1620443839.382300","reply_count":7,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UBDMG6N2J"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ENt=S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f069103-2a80-4b06-af14-da1ed1035ec6","type":"message","user":"UBDMG6N2J","text":"ですねぇ。。ちょっと後で時間とって調べてみます。","ts":"1620443816.381800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"slow-loris","count":1,"users":["U72TB62UF"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q6khT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71bf6692-4060-4224-b7db-68c9560d21dd","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"一応で `Hiragino¥ Sans¥ W3¥ 18` でguifontwideしてみましたが、ダメでした。","ts":"1620443784.381300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AgI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a4af1825-656a-4352-9671-3f6f83b7eb27","type":"message","user":"UBDMG6N2J","text":"うーん、たしかにうまく動かない","ts":"1620443649.380500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J+Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"012a3228-6705-4741-aeae-d8fe907f8d60","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"`2021/05/08 12:12:10.784600 356848.433 detect font family: Hiragino Sans W3 18`\nこっちを設定すべきのかな。","ts":"1620443624.380300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rfU6V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b57f8854-7a50-4a3a-8651-ddea1703974d","type":"message","user":"UBDMG6N2J","text":"私の環境ではguifont=*で指定した際以下が出ますね。\n```2021/05/08 12:09:22.446488 15915.055 detect font family: Hiragino Maru Gothic ProN W4 13```","ts":"1620443492.379900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IZ0OZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c42fc6b0-ef67-474c-befb-0d6e910dafaf","type":"message","user":"UBDMG6N2J","text":"あーそのログはフォントの読み込みログではないですね。ちょっとデバッグログがカオスで申し訳ない。。。","ts":"1620443462.379400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dbtb="}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9b149d0-f8d0-431f-b2b2-11f734339b0e","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"```2021/05/08 12:07:57.427607 103491.440 start creating word cache: :set guifontwide=HiraginoSans-W7:h18\n2021/05/08 12:07:57.428724 103492.554 finished creating word cache: :set guifontwide=HiraginoSans-W7:h18```\nと出たので、フォントは読めているぽいですね。\ndebug-goneovim.txtにエラーらしき内容はありません。","ts":"1620443369.378900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JwCaT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56d23506-b8eb-42b7-90c7-4f1d34c2b36c","type":"message","user":"UBDMG6N2J","text":"デフォはsetting.toml見てますが、init.vim に guifont 設定がある場合は上書きされロードされます","ts":"1620443277.378000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8G2dn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f841e1b3-db1e-4097-a88a-5ba19725731e","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"`2021/05/08 12:06:15.716038 1779.849 detect font family: Monaco Regular 12`\nフォント周りで出るのはこれだけですね。\nsetting.tomlに設定されている、フォントファミリーだけを見ている？","ts":"1620443230.377200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vIz1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7712284-b31a-4c05-8847-e44b247d7d30","type":"message","user":"UBDMG6N2J","text":"私の方でも調べてみます。","ts":"1620443156.376400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7++n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3a7bd56-93b8-484f-bd3f-6f7173c281c9","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"見てみます。","ts":"1620443095.376100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"myCz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9eb75664-9e5e-4950-8f03-8fec9b0d0d15","type":"message","user":"UBDMG6N2J","text":"``` /Applications/goneovim.app/Contents/MacOS/goneovim --debug=/Users/akiyoshi/debug-goneovim.txt```\nこんな感じでコマンドラインで起動すると、--debugで指定したファイルにデバッグ情報はけます。デバッグ情報にフォントの情報もでるのですが、どんな感じで出ますかね","ts":"1620443007.375900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"la2K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa963c43-7854-4a05-9b3a-cff4b8734297","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"\u0026gt; うーむ、フォントのハンドリングは最終的にはQt側にまかせているので、Qt側が与えられた文字列で特定できてない可能性が高い、、、かなぁ\nですよね……。ここをあえていじっているとは考えられなかったので悩んでました。","ts":"1620442979.375300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"umXuR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9ccc239-4877-4e6e-8a8d-de70d31bb281","type":"message","user":"UBDMG6N2J","text":"うーむ、フォントのハンドリングは最終的にはQt側にまかせているので、Qt側が与えられた文字列で特定できてない可能性が高い、、、かなぁ","ts":"1620442942.374000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+Qc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73ec5187-030b-4985-9cd2-c82b6152ad32","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"gvimだと `set guifontwide=HiraginoSans-W7:h18` で動くのですが、goneovimだとうまく動かない感じです（コマンドラインから直接設定しても動かず）。","ts":"1620442887.372800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fw/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"691d8d3c-ae6b-4923-9525-15298fd83b0f","type":"message","user":"UBDMG6N2J","text":"それはおそらく指定する文字列が異なっている可能性が高いと思います。コマンドラインで試して、上手くいく文字列をinit.vimに指定すれば動くはず。。","ts":"1620442795.371900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TXXDZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e653030b-13ef-4877-add7-4174fcdb0d31","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"guifontのフォント名の指定が、vimの場合と違うのかしら。","ts":"1620442769.371500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y4Jh+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"26353556-5f37-4b0b-9c92-484c5cff3705","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"set guifont=*でダイアログから設定した場合はうまくフォントの設定ができますが、init.vimに書くと表示が壊れるようです。","ts":"1620442731.370200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IrgV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d2dae86-67fe-47ba-8ef7-c4c047f6cb2f","type":"message","user":"UBDMG6N2J","text":"gui_running は効かないんですが、以下のようにすることでgoneovimだけ読み込むことができると思います。\n```if exists('g:goneovim')\n  set laststatus=0\nendif```\n","ts":"1620442688.368700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U72TB62UF"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mn0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f174fe96-31fb-43a6-823c-20859de11bda","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"nvimとgui_runningで区別可能かな。","ts":"1620442664.368100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hDVs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a5b47fad-c953-41e4-a16a-3d599e01ab79","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"gVimの `has(\"gui_running\")` ってNeovimでも効くんでしたっけ","ts":"1620442641.367200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ag4mj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c78c9c1e-088b-44e0-83d4-cf96bddb7faa","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"Neovimって `$MYGVIMRC` 読むんでしたっけ","ts":"1620442629.366900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_i