delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2tn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0cc008d-35fd-45d6-a4cb-e9ad7d995985","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"`ヒラギノ角ゴシック set guifontwide=HiraginoSans-W7:h18` すると、明朝体のフォントが適用される。","ts":"1620442281.362800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XcIh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d165a83-1dd7-4872-b192-bb3a51548147","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"```## You can write a vimscript to be executed after goneovim starts,\n## for example to disable the vimscript that Goneovim has embedded internally.\n## GinitVim = '''\n##  let g:hoge = 'fuga'\n## '''\n# Ginitvim = \"\"```\nこれかー","ts":"1620441363.361900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EyNWD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a590fa4-adf0-41d0-9e23-2c5b72a74761","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ambiwidthのオプションはなさげだからGinitvimオプション使って書くしかないのかな","ts":"1620441204.361600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wYn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a92cd9a6-c5fe-4ccc-bc92-3b7a1acfee27","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"なんと。","ts":"1620441130.361100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"neGR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16016adc-a076-4818-9735-e6a91f7c08a3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"tomlらしい \u003chttps://github.com/akiyosi/goneovim/wiki/Usage\u003e","ts":"1620440911.359400","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: akiyosi/goneovim","id":1,"title":"akiyosi/goneovim","title_link":"https://github.com/akiyosi/goneovim/wiki/Usage","text":"Neovim GUI written in Golang, using a Golang qt backend - akiyosi/goneovim","image_url":"https://repository-images.githubusercontent.com/107124394/75fe6100-fd5a-11e9-8e67-797dbd458f70","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https: