49X","text":"私は分けるほうがつらそうなイメージ","ts":"1620440028.355300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"usnnr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b8985ec5-d067-43b6-9a31-74de249f335a","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"日本語を書くためだけの環境にする予定なので、問題なさそう。\nコードを書くときはiTermからneovim使うし。","ts":"1620439948.355000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4svT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"691c82ea-b78a-4640-aedd-e33ee55a9158","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ambiwidth触りたくない","ts":"1620439863.354200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HpHu8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ea5a28e-95e5-4122-8184-f8354a367373","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"ambiwidth=doubleは魔境","ts":"1620439842.353900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CjXM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7451f544-5d2f-453a-a26e-6a842b3917e2","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"あ、できた。\nset ambiwidth=double","ts":"1620439806.353600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Nf="}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d79b935-6c91-41a1-a8ee-4003086cddda","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"MacVim(gvim)だと、以下の設定で動いています。\n\n```set guifont=RuikaMonoSeikyo-07:h17\nset guifontwide=HiraginoSans-W7:h18```","ts":"1620439741.353400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nPV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"646f3ac4-42a0-4fe5-9105-cde7e2dc37eb","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"HackGen Console使ってるAlacritty上のNeovimでもそうなりますね\n僕は諦めてそのまま使ってますけど","ts":"1620439711.353100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"50KG5"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"\u003c@U